<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21078] make deb packages reproducible</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21078</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;    Debian now requires packages to be reproducible, so that anyone can&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    rebuild a package and verify that it matches the published binary&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    (&lt;a href="https://lists.debian.org/debian-devel-announce/2026/05/msg00001.html" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://lists.debian.org/debian-devel-announce/2026/05/msg00001.html&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Lustre debs built from the same tree on the same machine did not&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    match: each build produced files with different checksums.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
